# Build output
# `dist` is DELIBERATELY tracked — see the root .gitignore. The production box
# cannot build (~560MB free, five other apps), so pm2 runs `server/dist` straight
# from the working tree. Ignoring it here while it is tracked means a build that
# adds a NEW file has that file silently skipped by `git add`, and the deploy gets
# a half-updated bundle. tsc happens to overwrite in place today; that is luck,
# not a guarantee.
build

